++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
The orbits are ordered first by decreasing incidence Icd_i, then by 
decreasing adjacency Adj_i, then by increasing orbitsize |O_i|
and then by decreasing value of Adj_{i,delta} 
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

